commit fe7293f7dbbef749ee5ae8916791689007aeecd0
Author: Chris <zhangjim117@163.com>
Date:   Thu Aug 27 13:01:43 2026 +0800

    fix(weixin): relax notification outbox contract and add outbound image support
    
    - notification outbox: accept any well-formed event type (dot/hyphen style,
      up to 128 chars) instead of the hardcoded recruiting.score_ready whitelist;
      schema_version, event_id, text and media validation unchanged. The type
      field is never consumed by the delivery path, so the whitelist only
      rejected new producer events into failed/ without adding safety.
    - weixin api: sendImage via trusted CDN upload endpoint (AES-128-ECB, 10MB cap)
    - production assembly: forward media from the outbox to sendNotification

